{"q":{"g":"In this quest you have to locate three houses on Shoreline. All three houses must be found in a single raid. If you leave the raid and have only found some of the houses, the quest will reset. You must extract in the same raid in which you found all the houses.","sh":[{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/7/7f/Quest_courtesy_visit_map.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20260213131619","c":"House locations marked on map"},{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/9/95/Chairman_house.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20191103193815","c":"The chairman's house"},{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/6/6a/Fisherman_house.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20191103193436","c":"The fisherman's house"},{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/1/1f/Priest_house.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20191103192818","c":"The priest's house"}]},"o":{},"x":{}}